# Smart City Booking Backend

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Key points:

- Node.js/Express + MongoDB, multi-tenant booking API (backend only)
- Frontends: Admin UI → github.com/ECCdigital/smart-city-booking-vue-app, Storefront → github.com/ECCdigital/smart-city-booking-store-front
- Business logic in `src/commons/`, HTTP in `src/platform/`
- English for code, comments, commits, PRs, and changelog entries
- DRY: reuse existing code; extract shared logic only on real duplication
- Run `npm test` and `npm run lint:check` before finishing
- Minimal diffs, no drive-by refactors, no commits unless asked
- Never commit secrets (`.env`)

Detailed guides: `docs/agents/`
